OL,3,GNEWSASister's anger at killer's bid for
OL,4,Aprison release
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sister of a woman who was beaten to
OL,7,Fdeath and buried at a Yorkshire beauty
OL,8,Fspot has spoken of her anger at the
OL,9,Fkiller's bid to be released from
OL,10,Fprison.
OL,12,FMartin Bell, then 45, attacked Gemma
OL,13,FSimpson, 23, with a hammer and stabbed
OL,14,Fher at his Harrogate flat in May 2000
OL,15,Fbefore dismembering and burying her
OL,16,Fbody at Brimham Rocks, near Pateley
OL,17,FBridge.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
