OL,3,GNEWSASister's anger at killer's bid for
OL,4,Aprison release
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2014, Bell confessed to the killing
OL,7,Fand in December that year was sentenced
OL,8,Fto life imprisonment with a minimum
OL,9,Fterm of 11 years and 205 days for
OL,10,Fmanslaughter with diminished
OL,11,Fresponsibility.
OL,13,FThe Parole Board confirmed a hearing is
OL,14,Fto take place - but Gemma's sister
OL,15,FNaomi Carrack said Bell is "not
OL,16,Fsomebody we want walking the streets of
OL,17,Fsociety".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
